{"id": "CHARACTER_CRC_097", "type": "character", "name": "影魔", "aliases": [], "keys": ["影魔"], "content": "影魔是寄居在沐透戒指中的存在，与沐透维持合作关系，曾向他索取恶人的灵魂。它自称监狱塔最后的守门人，洛掌握的资料却将它列作犯人；它在塔中的身份与遭到收押的经过仍有分歧〔uncertain〕。洛曾强制唤出影魔，询问其身份和职责，并以收押相威胁。\n\n影魔曾在危险中提醒、援护沐透，也会拒绝应答或休眠。它在水手相关冲突中出手后失去回应，此后状态未明，不能据此确认它已经死亡。", "canon_status": "confirmed", "canon_layer": "original_campaign", "importance": "medium", "sources": [{"document": "D:/备份文件/901记录/TRPG outputs/设定 人物/人物卡资料集_检索版.md", "reference": "lines 916–927"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-01/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 3; msg845721 / #2"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-01/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 5; msg845760 / #4"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-01/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 7; msg845764 / #6"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-02/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 7; msg847669 / #56"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-03/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 35; msg859330 / #134"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-03/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 39; msg859850 / #138"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-04/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 19; msg862968 / #168"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-04/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 33; msg864233 / #182"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-08/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 21; msg955484 / #370"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.