{"id": "CHARACTER_CRC_102", "type": "character", "name": "阿伊达", "aliases": ["阿依达"], "keys": ["阿伊达", "阿依达"], "content": "阿伊达是退隐后育有一子的传奇流浪士兵，维尔是他的儿子。维尔在考古探险后患上怪病，阿伊达为此求医，并与沐透合作寻找、夺回有关器物。他为救子提供材料和协助，事后承认欠沐透恩情，双方由此建立互助关系。\n\n阿伊达后来向沐透表示，自己已经正式注册为游击士，并会留在帝都。他能参与危险行动，但自述更擅长对付少量目标，不擅长指挥；儿子的病是否完全治愈，当时仍未确认。", "canon_status": "confirmed", "canon_layer": "original_campaign", "importance": "medium", "sources": [{"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-05/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 23; msg868539 / #222"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-05/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 31; msg878868 / #230"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-09/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 25; msg1042442 / #424"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-05/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 43; msg881995 / #242"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-06/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 6; msg895365 / #255"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-06/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 33; msg912204 / #282"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-07/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 47; msg950942 / #346"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-05/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 47; msg893869 / #246"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-06/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 24; msg900327 / #273"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-09/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 27; msg1042494 / #426"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-10/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 23; msg1160997 / #472"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-06/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 35; msg913705 / #284"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-06/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 37; msg914004 / #286"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-05/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 27; msg869475 / #226"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-05/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 39; msg880017 / #238"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/output/replay_f_review/v1/characters/author_profiles.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 71; entity_id=CRC_102; author_sections and source_refs"}], "notes": "F1人物条目第一版待用户审核。对应CRC_102；作者档案与运行卡另存，开局可用范围以opening字段为准。原线后期经历不是重玩未来承诺。"}
{"id": "CHARACTER_CRC_103", "type": "character", "name": "维尔", "aliases": [], "keys": ["维尔"], "content": "维尔是阿伊达的儿子，也是一名考古学徒。他在一次探险后出现睡眠、清醒周期异常的怪病。原线中，沐透在维尔未清醒时为他装上Faer；装具激活后，他一度失控并攻击娜迦。\n\n维尔醒来后害怕再受装具支配，希望将它上缴国家。此后他接受检查，并获得插班学习的安排。他自述出现了新的魔力与水元素亲和，但当时尚未完全控制Faer；相关力量的出现也没有证明他的怪病已经根治。", "canon_status": "confirmed", "canon_layer": "original_campaign", "importance": "medium", "sources": [{"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-05/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 29; msg869542 / #228"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-05/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 31; msg878868 / #230"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-05/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 37; msg880010 / #236"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-07/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 45; msg950844 / #344"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-07/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 10; msg929554 / #309"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-07/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 11; msg931036 / #310"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-07/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 15; msg931924 / #314"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-07/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 19; msg939232 / #318"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-09/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 27; msg1042494 / #426"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-07/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 25; msg948659 / #324"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-09/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 43; msg1046862 / #442"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/output/replay_f_review/v1/characters/author_profiles.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 72; entity_id=CRC_103; author_sections and source_refs"}], "notes": "F1人物条目第一版待用户审核。对应CRC_103；作者档案与运行卡另存，开局可用范围以opening字段为准。原线后期经历不是重玩未来承诺。"}
{"id": "CHARACTER_CRC_104", "type": "character", "name": "拉塞尔博士", "aliases": ["拉塞尔", "塞拉尔", "赛博尔"], "keys": ["拉塞尔博士", "拉塞尔", "塞拉尔", "赛博尔"], "content": "拉塞尔博士是帝都研究所中接待沐透与维尔的研究者，并将维尔认作新来的插班生。面对陌生的宝石魔法与腰带，他先探测器物、绘制结构图，再归还样本并召集专家研议。\n\n博士愿意考虑新的研究委托，但说明实验需要正式委托、材料、实际样本和时间。他对魔偶、魔核与宝石技术有研究经验，也承认制造成本和材料适配方面的限制。沐透提出逆转Phantom的设想时，他尚未完成对应器具或验证成功流程。", "canon_status": "confirmed", "canon_layer": "original_campaign", "importance": "medium", "sources": [{"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-09/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 33; msg1043390 / #432"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-09/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 39; msg1044705 / #438"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-09/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 43; msg1046862 / #442"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-09/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 41; msg1046096 / #440"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-10/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 3; msg1049842 / #452"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-10/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 5; msg1051559 / #454"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-09/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 45; msg1047210 / #444"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-09/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 49; msg1047852 / #448"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-09/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 40; msg1044891 / #439"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-09/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 48; msg1047768 / #447"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-10/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 13; msg1056638 / #462"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-09/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 47; msg1047660 / #446"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/output/replay_f_review/v1/characters/author_profiles.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 73; entity_id=CRC_104; author_sections and source_refs"}], "notes": "F1人物条目第一版待用户审核。对应CRC_104；作者档案与运行卡另存，开局可用范围以opening字段为准。原线后期经历不是重玩未来承诺。 同场“拉塞尔、塞拉尔、赛博尔”异写留作姓名考据；与主线博士是否同一人仍未确认。"}
{"id": "CHARACTER_CRC_105", "type": "character", "name": "逆羽·霞", "aliases": [], "keys": ["逆羽·霞"], "content": "逆羽·霞是雷光直属第一大队第二小队的队长，这支小队专门处理白色魔法师相关事务。她与副队长幻翎·洛救援沐透，听取他的经历与情报，并因他同白魔的渊源邀请他加入。\n\n沐透最初对招募有异议，后来领取了小队铁牌，并以队员身份活动。霞曾赠送羽毛，并说明可以借此定位；羽毛的完整作用范围尚未明确。", "canon_status": "confirmed", "canon_layer": "original_campaign", "importance": "medium", "sources": [{"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-04/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 35; msg864341 / #184"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-04/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 39; msg864444 / #188"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-04/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 41; msg864574 / #190"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-04/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 45; msg864656 / #194"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-04/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 49; msg864800 / #198"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "reference": "lines 88"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-08/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 37; msg957923 / #386"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-09/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 36; msg1044064 / #435"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/output/replay_f_review/v1/characters/author_profiles.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 74; entity_id=CRC_105; author_sections and source_refs"}], "notes": "F1人物条目第一版待用户审核。对应CRC_105；作者档案与运行卡另存，开局可用范围以opening字段为准。原线后期经历不是重玩未来承诺。"}
{"id": "CHARACTER_CRC_106", "type": "character", "name": "幻翎·洛", "aliases": [], "keys": ["幻翎·洛"], "content": "幻翎·洛是雷光直属第一大队第二小队的副队长，与队长逆羽·霞共同处理白色魔法师相关事务。他救护沐透，核查军籍与异常能量，并强制唤出戒指中的影魔，询问它与监狱塔的关系。\n\n洛在听取白魔情报后，基于共同目标邀请沐透合作，安排活动资金、交通与医疗支援，后来还处理活俘运送。他曾用金羽暂时抑制毒素，并与其他医护人员接续救治；暂时抑毒并不意味着已经完成治疗。", "canon_status": "confirmed", "canon_layer": "original_campaign", "importance": "medium", "sources": [{"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-04/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 37; msg864394 / #186"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-04/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 39; msg864444 / #188"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-04/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 41; msg864574 / #190"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-04/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 45; msg864656 / #194"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-04/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 47; msg864765 / #196"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "reference": "lines 88"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/output/replay_f_review/v1/characters/author_profiles.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 75; entity_id=CRC_106; author_sections and source_refs"}], "notes": "F1人物条目第一版待用户审核。对应CRC_106；作者档案与运行卡另存，开局可用范围以opening字段为准。原线后期经历不是重玩未来承诺。"}
{"id": "CHARACTER_CRC_107", "type": "character", "name": "劳霖", "aliases": [], "keys": ["劳霖"], "content": "劳霖自称帝国边关步兵第九大队的士兵，奉逆羽·霞与幻翎·洛的命令协查。他照护昏迷的沐透近一周，之后随同行动，参与救援、赴宫和记录报告。\n\n劳霖称自己与御临风是老朋友，托沐透代为问候；现存经历尚未记到两人重逢或口信送达。他猜测御临风去了山脉，这只是劳霖当时的判断〔character_belief〕。", "canon_status": "confirmed", "canon_layer": "original_campaign", "importance": "medium", "sources": [{"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-08/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 25; msg955864 / #374"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-08/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 29; msg956231 / #378"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-08/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 31; msg956348 / #380"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-08/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 35; msg957028 / #384"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-09/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 23; msg1042344 / #422"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-10/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 17; msg1083375 / #466"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-10/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 23; msg1160997 / #472"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/output/replay_f_review/v1/characters/author_profiles.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 76; entity_id=CRC_107; author_sections and source_refs"}], "notes": "F1人物条目第一版待用户审核。对应CRC_107；作者档案与运行卡另存，开局可用范围以opening字段为准。原线后期经历不是重玩未来承诺。"}
{"id": "CHARACTER_CRC_108", "type": "character", "name": "王骑", "aliases": [], "keys": ["王骑"], "content": "王骑在军方会面中自报为“雷公”直属第一大队的大队长之一。他听取沐透关于白色魔法师的情报，批准暂住安排，并承诺为相关研究提供正式委托。\n\n这次会面使沐透获得了军方支持与联络渠道，但当时尚未见正式委托文书送达研究所，也未出现研究完成的结果。王骑的完整职权范围未明。", "canon_status": "confirmed", "canon_layer": "original_campaign", "importance": "medium", "sources": [{"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-10/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 9; msg1052875 / #458"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-10/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 11; msg1055378 / #460"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-10/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 13; msg1056638 / #462"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/output/replay_f_review/v1/characters/author_profiles.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 77; entity_id=CRC_108; author_sections and source_refs"}], "notes": "F1人物条目第一版待用户审核。对应CRC_108；作者档案与运行卡另存，开局可用范围以opening字段为准。原线后期经历不是重玩未来承诺。"}
{"id": "CHARACTER_CRC_109", "type": "character", "name": "克拉肯", "aliases": ["Kraken", "北海巨妖"], "keys": ["克拉肯", "Kraken", "北海巨妖"], "content": "克拉肯自称北海巨妖，寄于维尔的心灵世界，并通过Faer相关器物与外界沟通。他向沐透、阿伊达等人解释装具的休眠、契约和供魔条件，也讲述自己与精灵王及古代历史的联系；这些古史内容属于他的陈述〔character_belief〕。\n\n克拉肯表示，维尔必须学习掌握魔力，并以意志抑制装具追杀娜迦的本能。他后来宣称契约已经成立，但这没有消除维尔此前的失控，也不代表维尔已经熟练控制Faer。", "canon_status": "character_belief", "canon_layer": "original_campaign", "importance": "medium", "sources": [{"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-05/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 45; msg893857 / #244"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-05/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 47; msg893869 / #246"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-05/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 49; msg893930 / #248"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-07/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 25; msg948659 / #324"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-07/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 27; msg948754 / #326"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/output/replay_f_review/v1/characters/author_profiles.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 78; entity_id=CRC_109; author_sections and source_refs"}], "notes": "F1人物条目第一版待用户审核。对应CRC_109；作者档案与运行卡另存，开局可用范围以opening字段为准。原线后期经历不是重玩未来承诺。"}
{"id": "CHARACTER_CRC_110", "type": "character", "name": "曼吉", "aliases": [], "keys": ["曼吉"], "content": "曼吉是驻镇法师，参与当地石化异常的调查与处置。他听取沐透关于炼石的推测后决定疏散，并曾为沐透治疗伤势，建议继续配药休养。\n\n曼吉在镇长宴会上受袭、中毒倒下，后来接受外来医疗救援。他与皮谢及地方行政共同调查异常，但当时并不知道结界的全部用途。", "canon_status": "confirmed", "canon_layer": "original_campaign", "importance": "medium", "sources": [{"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-01/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 39; msg846736 / #38"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-03/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 15; msg855949 / #114"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-03/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 29; msg857328 / #128"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-03/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 31; msg859081 / #130"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-04/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 7; msg862103 / #156"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/output/replay_f_review/v1/characters/author_profiles.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 79; entity_id=CRC_110; author_sections and source_refs"}], "notes": "F1人物条目第一版待用户审核。对应CRC_110；作者档案与运行卡另存，开局可用范围以opening字段为准。原线后期经历不是重玩未来承诺。"}
{"id": "CHARACTER_CRC_111", "type": "character", "name": "皮谢", "aliases": [], "keys": ["皮谢"], "content": "皮谢是镇守卫队长。他认出石像中的失踪部下后组织挖掘、寻找法师，并与曼吉及沐透协作调查。起初，他依据镇长过去的政绩信任对方；宴会上遭毒刺袭击、获救后，才知道镇长身份遭到冒用，并为自己未能识破而自责。\n\n皮谢提供了有关商队朝帝都方向行进的线索，但没有掌握商队的完整路线与后续去向。", "canon_status": "confirmed", "canon_layer": "original_campaign", "importance": "medium", "sources": [{"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-02/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 31; msg849060 / #80"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-02/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 33; msg849140 / #82"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-02/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 45; msg852225 / #94"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-02/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 47; msg852561 / #96"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-04/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 21; msg863008 / #170"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-05/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 5; msg865501 / #204"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/output/replay_f_review/v1/characters/author_profiles.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 80; entity_id=CRC_111; author_sections and source_refs"}], "notes": "F1人物条目第一版待用户审核。对应CRC_111；作者档案与运行卡另存，开局可用范围以opening字段为准。原线后期经历不是重玩未来承诺。"}
{"id": "CHARACTER_CRC_112", "type": "character", "name": "雅莱佩", "aliases": [], "keys": ["雅莱佩"], "content": "雅莱佩是当地行政庭的前台办事人员，承担接报、内部联络和向来访者反馈消息的工作。沐透报告异常后，她联系镇长与法师，转达商队调查和帝都回信的情况，并为沐透带路。", "canon_status": "confirmed", "canon_layer": "original_campaign", "importance": "medium", "sources": [{"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-01/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 27; msg846449 / #26"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-01/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 33; msg846685 / #32"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-01/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 37; msg846712 / #36"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-01/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 49; msg847456 / #48"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-02/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 27; msg848743 / #76"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/output/replay_f_review/v1/characters/author_profiles.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 81; entity_id=CRC_112; author_sections and source_refs"}], "notes": "F1人物条目第一版待用户审核。对应CRC_112；作者档案与运行卡另存，开局可用范围以opening字段为准。原线后期经历不是重玩未来承诺。"}
{"id": "CHARACTER_CRC_113", "type": "character", "name": "夏洛克·査丁", "aliases": [], "keys": ["夏洛克·査丁"], "content": "夏洛克·査丁是当地镇长，居民对他过去的治理有良好评价。沐透参与调查期间，宴会上以镇长外貌出现的人投毒，随后蜕变为粘液魔物；这名冒用身份者声称真正的镇长已经死亡。\n\n真镇长的死亡当时只有魔物口供，尚无独立确认〔character_belief〕。居民对旧日善政的评价属于真人的过往声誉，宴会中的投毒和袭击则是冒名者的行为。", "canon_status": "confirmed", "canon_layer": "original_campaign", "importance": "medium", "sources": [{"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-01/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 29; msg846483 / #28"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-04/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 21; msg863008 / #170"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-04/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 23; msg863110 / #172"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/output/replay_f_review/v1/characters/author_profiles.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 82; entity_id=CRC_113; author_sections and source_refs"}], "notes": "F1人物条目第一版待用户审核。对应CRC_113；作者档案与运行卡另存，开局可用范围以opening字段为准。原线后期经历不是重玩未来承诺。"}
{"id": "CHARACTER_CRC_114", "type": "character", "name": "博恩婆婆", "aliases": [], "keys": ["博恩婆婆"], "content": "博恩婆婆在当地管理文书。镇长宴会上，她没有饮杯，曾暗中扯动沐透的衣物以示警，随后离席。\n\n事后，博恩婆婆向沐透讲述儿子失踪的情况，并称自己亲眼看见镇长向酒茶中投放东西。她也说曾把宝石送给欧吉尔德，但并不掌握全部交货地点。儿子的下落和所投物质的具体性质当时仍未明确。", "canon_status": "confirmed", "canon_layer": "original_campaign", "importance": "medium", "sources": [{"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-04/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 15; msg862637 / #164"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-04/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 17; msg862763 / #166"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-mutou/page-05/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 1; msg865053 / #200"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/output/replay_f_review/v1/characters/author_profiles.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 83; entity_id=CRC_114; author_sections and source_refs"}], "notes": "F1人物条目第一版待用户审核。对应CRC_114；作者档案与运行卡另存，开局可用范围以opening字段为准。原线后期经历不是重玩未来承诺。"}
{"id": "CHARACTER_CRC_116", "type": "character", "name": "埃弗纳斯", "aliases": ["埃佛纳斯"], "keys": ["埃弗纳斯", "埃佛纳斯"], "content": "埃弗纳斯是科普卢村灾难的幸存者，称艾鲁尔为养父，萨米尔与珊蒂斯为好友。他获纳萨力克救助后，愿意报恩并调查村灾真相，但明确拒绝杀害无辜者。\n\n埃弗纳斯随后接受了保密和报告要求，服药开启魔力池，戴上项圈并领取行旅物资，成为纳萨力克在外活动的本地代理。他当时尚未完成魔法训练。离开后，他又在镇上受到美杜莎与养父外貌男子的胁迫；这段同行并非自愿合作，男子是否延续了养父原有的人格仍未确认。", "canon_status": "confirmed", "canon_layer": "original_campaign", "importance": "medium", "sources": [{"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-01/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 1; msg922950 / #0"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-01/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 10; msg923287 / #9"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-01/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 47; msg949503 / #46"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-01/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 6; msg923247 / #5"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-01/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 8; msg923275 / #7"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-01/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 14; msg923423 / #13"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-01/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 49; msg952746 / #48"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-01/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 50; msg954249 / #49"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-02/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 1; msg954393 / #50"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tave