{"id": "CHARACTER_CRC_117", "type": "character", "name": "雅儿贝德", "aliases": [], "keys": ["雅儿贝德"], "content": "雅儿贝德是安兹的下属，在他身侧接待来客并执行传令工作。她曾呈交战地图、报告与资料，安兹认可她与迪米乌哥斯共同取得的情报，并命她传召守护者。\n\n雅儿贝德对安兹表现出强烈的主从敬意。来客失礼时，她曾发怒，但在安兹解释情况后立即收起追究，服从他的处置。", "canon_status": "confirmed", "canon_layer": "original_campaign", "importance": "medium", "sources": [{"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-01/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 1; msg922950 / #0"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-01/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 3; msg922976 / #2"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-second/NO.901MurginMunalos，我重临世界之日，诸逆臣皆当死去！ - 页 15/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 12; msg959984 / #711"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-second/NO.901MurginMunalos，我重临世界之日，诸逆臣皆当死去！ - 页 16/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 12; msg967530 / #761"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/output/replay_f_review/v1/characters/author_profiles.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 86; entity_id=CRC_117; author_sections and source_refs"}], "notes": "F1人物条目第一版待用户审核。对应CRC_117；作者档案与运行卡另存，开局可用范围以opening字段为准。原线后期经历不是重玩未来承诺。"}
{"id": "CHARACTER_CRC_118", "type": "character", "name": "迪米乌哥斯", "aliases": [], "keys": ["迪米乌哥斯"], "content": "迪米乌哥斯自报为纳萨力克第七阶层守护者，种族为恶魔。他接待埃弗纳斯、解释误会，带他去见安兹，并奉命护送、交付装备和指引道路。\n\n迪米乌哥斯与亚乌菈协作准备行旅安排，也与雅儿贝德共同取得情报，得到安兹认可。安兹曾说他不精通魔法；他的内部联络和通行权限已有实际用途，完整战斗能力尚未展示。", "canon_status": "confirmed", "canon_layer": "original_campaign", "importance": "medium", "sources": [{"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-01/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 47; msg949503 / #46"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-01/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 49; msg952746 / #48"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-02/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 1; msg954393 / #50"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-02/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 3; msg954561 / #52"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-02/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 9; msg955110 / #58"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-02/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 13; msg955598 / #62"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-02/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 17; msg956355 / #66"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-02/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 19; msg957027 / #68"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-02/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 7; msg954760 / #56"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-second/NO.901MurginMunalo