{"id": "CHARACTER_CRC_119", "type": "character", "name": "亚乌菈·贝拉·菲欧拉", "aliases": ["亚乌菈"], "keys": ["亚乌菈·贝拉·菲欧拉", "亚乌菈"], "content": "亚乌菈·贝拉·菲欧拉是纳萨力克第六阶层守护者，种族为纯正黑暗精灵。她接待埃弗纳斯，并按安兹的安排准备马匹和行旅物资。安兹称她为驯兽师；她也把马雷作为可以提供自然魔法帮助的人选介绍给来客，但当时尚未形成正式师徒关系。\n\n亚乌菈曾把埃弗纳斯称作“半个同胞”，这是她对来客种族的说法，未据此确定埃弗纳斯的完整血统。", "canon_status": "confirmed", "canon_layer": "original_campaign", "importance": "medium", "sources": [{"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-01/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 47; msg949503 / #46"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-01/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 49; msg952746 / #48"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-02/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 1; msg954393 / #50"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-02/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 9; msg955110 / #58"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-02/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 15; msg955870 / #64"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-02/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 17; msg956355 / #66"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-02/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 7; msg954760 / #56"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/output/replay_f_review/v1/characters/author_profiles.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 88; entity_id=CRC_119; author_sections and source_refs"}], "notes": "F1人物条目第一版待用户审核。对应CRC_119；作者档案与运行卡另存，开局可用范围以opening字段为准。原线后期经历不是重玩未来承诺。"}
{"id": "CHARACTER_CRC_120", "type": "character", "name": "皮奇", "aliases": [], "keys": ["皮奇"], "content": "皮奇自报纳萨力克副料理长，在第九层为埃弗纳斯递菜单、推荐饮食、烹饪并上菜，这次接待没有收费。他也向来客说明纳萨力克的日常生活规则，以及其他至尊离去、安兹留守的情况。\n\n谈及离去者的下落时，皮奇承认自己并不知道答案。他对离去原因的解释包含猜测，尚不能视为已经确认的历史〔character_belief〕。", "canon_status": "confirmed", "canon_layer": "original_campaign", "importance": "medium", "sources": [{"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-01/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 27; msg927646 / #26"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-01/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 31; msg928618 / #30"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-01/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 33; msg929389 / #32"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-01/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 39; msg934724 / #38"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-01/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 41; msg939231 / #40"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-01/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 29; msg928408 / #28"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/output/replay_f_review/v1/characters/author_profiles.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 89; entity_id=CRC_120; author_sections and source_refs"}], "notes": "F1人物条目第一版待用户审核。对应CRC_120；作者档案与运行卡另存，开局可用范围以opening字段为准。原线后期经历不是重玩未来承诺。"}
{"id": "CHARACTER_CRC_122", "type": "character", "name": "美杜莎", "aliases": [], "keys": ["美杜莎"], "content": "美杜莎是忠于白色魔法师的Phantom，以黑衣女性的形象出现在埃弗纳斯面前。她与一名具有埃弗纳斯养父外貌的男子同行；男子称她“大人”，并就后续行动向她请示。\n\n在镇中胁迫事件里，美杜莎将商人妻子的尸体拖进屋内、锁门，并首肯让埃弗纳斯带路引见救助者的要求。她听到迪米乌哥斯的名字时摇头示意不认识，这一表现不足以确定她内心的全部知情范围。当时一行人尚未抵达纳萨力克，也未完成交涉。", "canon_status": "confirmed", "canon_layer": "original_campaign", "importance": "medium", "sources": [{"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-02/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 29; msg978566 / #78"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-02/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 49; msg1000177 / #98"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-03/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 3; msg1016053 / #102"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-03/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 5; msg1022610 / #104"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-03/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 12; msg1081976 / #111"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-02/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 47; msg997679 / #96"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "reference": "lines 146"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/output/replay_f_review/v1/characters/author_profiles.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 91; entity_id=CRC_122; author_sections and source_refs"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-03/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 7; msg1034858 / #106"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-03/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 9; msg1055352 / #108"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-03/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 11; msg1058086 / #110"}], "notes": "F1人物条目第一版待用户审核。对应CRC_122；作者档案与运行卡另存，开局可用范围以opening字段为准。原线后期经历不是重玩未来承诺。 美杜莎的姓名、Phantom身份及对白魔忠诚采用用户确认；不合并沐透线同名飞马相关人物的能力。"}
{"id": "CHARACTER_CRC_123", "type": "character", "name": "欧登", "aliases": [], "keys": ["欧登"], "content": "欧登是当地镇长，与守备队长科斯雷共同接待埃弗纳斯，听取科普卢村灾情。他们安排少量人员侦察、联系驻军，并通过文书寻找游击士等援手；欧登同时为报案者提供留宿。\n\n后来，欧登在镇上遇见埃弗纳斯与身后的美杜莎、养父外貌男子。冲突发生后，法师贝克带他撤离；此前求援是否收到响应，尚未见结果。", "canon_status": "confirmed", "canon_layer": "original_campaign", "importance": "medium", "sources": [{"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-02/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 39; msg990702 / #88"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-02/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 43; msg993920 / #92"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-02/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 38; msg990696 / #87"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-03/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 11; msg1058086 / #110"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/output/replay_f_review/v1/characters/author_profiles.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 92; entity_id=CRC_123; author_sections and source_refs"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-03/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 3; msg1016053 / #102"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-03/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 7; msg1034858 / #106"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-03/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 9; msg1055352 / #108"}], "notes": "F1人物条目第一版待用户审核。对应CRC_123；作者档案与运行卡另存，开局可用范围以opening字段为准。原线后期经历不是重玩未来承诺。"}
{"id": "CHARACTER_CRC_124", "type": "character", "name": "科斯雷", "aliases": [], "keys": ["科斯雷"], "content": "科斯雷是当地镇守备队长，与镇长欧登共同处理科普卢村灾情。他原本准备亲自前去调查，听取埃弗纳斯对敌方实力的担忧后，改为留在镇中组织防守，并与欧登商定侦察和求援安排。\n\n这次商议后的明确部署是科斯雷留守，现存经历尚未记到他亲自出城调查的结果。", "canon_status": "confirmed", "canon_layer": "original_campaign", "importance": "medium", "sources": [{"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-02/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 39; msg990702 / #88"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-02/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 41; msg992345 / #90"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-02/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 43; msg993920 / #92"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-02/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 38; msg990696 / #87"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/output/replay_f_review/v1/characters/author_profiles.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 93; entity_id=CRC_124; author_sections and source_refs"}], "notes": "F1人物条目第一版待用户审核。对应CRC_124；作者档案与运行卡另存，开局可用范围以opening字段为准。原线后期经历不是重玩未来承诺。"}
{"id": "CHARACTER_CRC_125", "type": "character", "name": "贝克", "aliases": [], "keys": ["贝克"], "content": "贝克是当地镇上的法师。欧登镇长遇见埃弗纳斯、美杜莎与养父外貌男子时，贝克阻止镇长贸然接近，并要求三人保持距离、不要行动。\n\n养父外貌男子随后掷出匕首袭击贝克，被他用魔法加持的法袍挡下。贝克随即带欧登撤离，警告周围居民避难，并开始施法呼叫援军；呼叫是否成功以及援军何时到达，当时尚未见结果。", "canon_status": "confirmed", "canon_layer": "original_campaign", "importance": "medium", "sources": [{"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-03/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 7; msg1034858 / #106"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-03/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 9; msg1055352 / #108"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-03/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 11; msg1058086 / #110"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-03/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 10; msg1056029 / #109"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/output/replay_f_review/v1/characters/author_profiles.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 94; entity_id=CRC_125; author_sections and source_refs"}, {"document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/extracted-great-tomb/page-03/posts.jsonl", "reference": "JSONL line 3; msg1016053 / #102"}], "notes": "F1人物条目第一版待用户审核。对应CRC_125；作者档案与运行卡另存，开局可用范围以opening字段为准。原线后期经历不是重玩未来承诺。"}
